Description: Linux platform & hardware monitoring driver for Minisforum UM790 Pro
 Minisforum platform and hardware monitoring kernel driver with in-kernel
 CPPC QoS, ACPI platform profile integration, and EC dynamic fan curve
 control for Minisforum UM790 Pro (Venus series).
